      "settings": {
        "title": "How We Select the Accessories We Carry",
        "copy": "Every item we carry is evaluated for how well it reflects MoMA’s core values: innovation, functionality, and design excellence. Some are directly featured in MoMA exhibitions or collections; other accessories share the same spirit of creative problem-solving.\nWhen selecting products, we prioritize:\nThoughtful reimagining of everyday objects\n\n• Solution-driven design that’s accessible at a range of price points\n• Items that demonstrate cultural or historical relevance\n• Custom designs made exclusively for MoMA\n\nAt MoMA Design Store, we want you to purchase thoughtfully made accessories that brighten your home, bring joy and endure.",
